  "idea": "LocalSend: share files between iPhone, Android, and PC with zero cables",
  "text": "Here is the fastest way to send files between different devices without AirDrop or cables. Moving raw footage between Windows and iPhone usually forces you through slow cloud uploads or messaging compression. Cloud drives throttle upload bandwidth, compress images, and clutter storage with duplicate folders. LocalSend fixes this by transferring files directly over local Wi-Fi using secure end-to-end encryption. You send gigabytes in seconds without internet access.",
